1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,516
Seven layers. Every screen.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,681
A background that loops,

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,624
your slides on top,

4
00:00:06,674 --> 00:00:09,010
a logo and a name over it all.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,911
Each one is its own layer.

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,150
Send it to every screen,

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,169
each with only the layers it needs.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,020
Change one. The rest don't move.

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,388
This is LayerCue.

10
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:25,200
It's free while it's in beta, on Mac and Windows.

